#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:2
msgid "Creating a project from a private repository"
msgstr "从私有仓库创建项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:6
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, projects can be connected to both private and public "
"repositories. There are two methods you can use to create a project from a "
"private repository:"
msgstr "在 |com_brand| 上，项目可连接到私有和公开仓库。你可以用两种方法从私有仓库创建项目："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:9
msgid "`Automatically create a project from a connected repository`_"
msgstr "`Automatically create a project from a connected repository`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:10
msgid ""
"If you have a |git_providers_or| service connected to your account, projects"
" can be created automatically from a connected private repository. We will "
"handle the configuration of your repository to allow cloning and pushing "
"status updates to trigger new builds for your project."
msgstr ""
"若你的账户已连接 |git_providers_or| "
"服务，项目可从已连接的私有仓库自动创建。我们会处理仓库配置，使其可被克隆，并推送状态更新以触发项目的新构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:15
msgid "We recommend this method for most projects."
msgstr "我们建议大多数项目采用此方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:17
msgid "`Manually create a project from a repository`_"
msgstr "`Manually create a project from a repository`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:18
msgid ""
"If your Git provider is unsupported or if your Read the Docs account is not "
"connected to your provider, you can still manually create a project against "
"a private repository. You will have to manually configure your Git provider "
"and repository after project creation."
msgstr ""
"若你的 Git 服务商不受支持，或 Read the Docs 账户未与之关联，仍可手动基于私有仓库创建项目。但项目创建后需手动配置你的 Git "
"服务商和仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:23
msgid "Automatically create a project from a connected repository"
msgstr "从已连接的仓库自动创建项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:28
msgid ""
"If your Read the Docs account has a connected |git_providers_or| account, "
"you should be able to automatically create a project from your repository. "
"Your account will need sufficient permissions to the repository to "
"automatically configure it."
msgstr ""
"若你的 Read the Docs 账户已关联 |git_providers_or| "
"账户，应能从你的仓库自动创建项目。你的账户需对该仓库有足够权限才能自动完成配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:32
msgid ""
"We recommend most users follow our :doc:`directions on automatically "
"creating projects </intro/add-project>` from a connected repository."
msgstr "我们建议大多数用户遵循我们的 :doc:`从已连接仓库自动创建项目的说明 </intro/add-project>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:35
msgid "Manually create a project from a repository"
msgstr "从仓库手动创建项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:37
msgid ""
"In the case that automatic project creation isn't supported or doesn't work "
"for your repository, projects may be able to be manually created and "
"configured. You can still clone the repository with SSH but you will have to"
" manually configure the repository SSH keys and webhooks."
msgstr "若自动创建项目不受支持或对你的仓库无效，项目仍可手动创建和配置。你依然可以用 SSH 克隆仓库，但需手动配置仓库的 SSH 密钥和 Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:44
msgid ":doc:`/guides/setup/git-repo-manual`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/setup/git-repo-manual`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:45
msgid ""
"An overview of all of the steps required to manually add a project. This "
"guide is useful for both projects using public and private repositories."
msgstr "手动添加项目所需全部步骤的概览。本指南对使用公开和私有仓库的项目都有用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:49
msgid "Creating a project manually"
msgstr "手动创建项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:51
msgid "Select an organization team to create the project in."
msgstr "选择要创建项目的组织团队。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:56
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Add project` from the main dashboard."
msgstr "在主仪表盘中选择 :guilabel:`Add project` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:57
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Configure manually` and then :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr "选择 :guilabel:`Configure manually` ，然后选择 :guilabel:`Continue` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select the organization team you'd like to create the project for. You must "
"be on a team with ``admin`` permission to do this."
msgstr "选择要为其创建项目的组织团队。你必须处于拥有 ``admin`` 权限的团队中才能操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the next form page you will manually configure your project's repository "
"details."
msgstr "在接下来的表单页面中手动配置项目的仓库信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:63
msgid "Specify your project and repository configuration."
msgstr "指定项目和仓库配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Repository URL` field, provide the repository's SSH or Git"
" URL. This URL usually starts with ``git@...``, for example "
"``git@github.com:readthedocs/readthedocs.org.git``."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`Repository URL` 字段中填写仓库的 SSH 或 Git URL。该 URL 通常以 ``git@...`` "
"开头，例如 ``git@github.com:readthedocs/readthedocs.org.git`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:70
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next`, select :guilabel:`Build on Read the Docs`, and "
"follow the instructions to add a :doc:`configuration file </config-"
"file/index>` to your repository. The project uses your repository's default "
"branch, you can change it later in the :guilabel:`Default branch` field of "
"your project's :menuselection:`Settings`."
msgstr ""
"点击 :guilabel:`Next` ，选择 :guilabel:`Build on Read the Docs` ，并按说明向仓库添加 "
":doc:`配置文件 </config-file/index>` 。项目默认使用仓库的默认分支，之后可在项目 "
":menuselection:`Settings` 的 :guilabel:`Default branch` 字段中更改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:74
msgid ""
"The project's first build should fail to clone your repository. This is "
"expected, your repository is not configured to allow access yet."
msgstr "项目的首次构建应会因无法克隆仓库而失败。这是预期现象——你的仓库尚未配置为允许访问。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:78
msgid "Configuring your repository"
msgstr "配置你的仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:80
msgid ""
"Each project is configured with an SSH key pair consisting of a public and "
"private key. Your repository will need to be configured with the public SSH "
"key in order to allow builds to clone your repository."
msgstr "每个项目都配置有一对 SSH 密钥（公钥和私钥）。你需要在仓库中配置该公钥，构建才能克隆你的仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:84
msgid "Project SSH key details."
msgstr "项目 SSH 密钥详情。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:89
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> SSH keys`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> SSH keys` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:90
msgid "Click on the fingerprint of the SSH key."
msgstr "点击 SSH 密钥的指纹。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:91
msgid "Copy the text from the :guilabel:`Public SSH key` field"
msgstr "复制 :guilabel:`Public SSH key` 字段中的文本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:92
msgid ""
"Next, configure your repository with this key, we've provided instructions "
"for common Git providers:"
msgstr "接下来用该密钥配置你的仓库，我们为常见 Git 服务商提供了说明："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:97
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:99
msgid ""
"For GitHub, you can use `deploy keys with read only access "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/developers/overview/managing-deploy-keys#deploy-"
"keys>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于 GitHub，你可以使用 `只读访问的部署密钥 <https://docs.github.com/en/developers/overview"
"/managing-deploy-keys#deploy-keys>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:102
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Deploy keys` of your repository on GitHub"
msgstr "前往 GitHub 上你仓库的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Deploy keys`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:103
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add deploy key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add deploy key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:104
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:113
msgid "Put a descriptive title and paste the public key you copied above."
msgstr "填写描述性标题并粘贴你上面复制的公钥。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:105
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:114
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:123
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:107
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:109
msgid ""
"For GitLab, you can use `deploy keys with read only access "
"<https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/deploy_keys/index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于 GitLab，你可以使用 `只读访问的部署密钥 "
"<https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/deploy_keys/index.html>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:111
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Repository` of your project on GitLab"
msgstr "前往 GitLab 上你项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Repository`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:112
msgid "Expand the :guilabel:`Deploy Keys` section"
msgstr "展开 :guilabel:`Deploy Keys` 区域"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:116
msgid "Bitbucket"
msgstr "Bitbucket"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:118
msgid ""
"For Bitbucket, you can use `access keys with read only access "
"<https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucket/access-keys-294486051.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于 Bitbucket，你可以使用 `只读访问的访问密钥 <https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucket"
"/access-keys-294486051.html>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:120
msgid "Go your project on Bitbucket"
msgstr "前往 Bitbucket 上你的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:121
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Repository Settings`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Repository Settings`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:122
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Access keys`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Access keys`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:124
msgid "Put a descriptive label and paste the public key you copied above."
msgstr "填写描述性标签并粘贴你上面复制的公钥。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:125
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add SSH key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add SSH key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:127
msgid "Azure DevOps"
msgstr "Azure DevOps"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:129
msgid ""
"For Azure DevOps, you can use `SSH key authentication "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/repos/git/use-ssh-keys-to-"
"authenticate?view=azure-devops>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于 Azure DevOps，你可以使用 `SSH 密钥认证 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/azure/devops/repos/git/use-ssh-keys-to-authenticate?view=azure-devops>`__"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:131
msgid "Go your Azure DevOps page"
msgstr "前往你的 Azure DevOps 页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:132
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`User settings`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`User settings`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:133
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`SSH public keys`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`SSH public keys`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:134
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`New key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`New key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:135
msgid "Put a descriptive name and paste the public key you copied above."
msgstr "填写描述性名称并粘贴你上面复制的公钥。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:136
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:138
msgid "Others"
msgstr "其他"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:140
msgid ""
"If you are using a provider not listed here, you should still be able to "
"configure your repository with your project's SSH key. Refer to your "
"provider's documentation for managing SSH keys on private repositories."
msgstr "若你使用此处未列出的服务商，仍应能用项目的 SSH 密钥配置你的仓库。请查阅该服务商关于在私有仓库上管理 SSH 密钥的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:145
msgid "Configuring repository webhooks"
msgstr "配置仓库 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:147
msgid ""
"Your repository will also need to be configured to push updates via webhooks"
" to Read the Docs on repository events. Webhook updates are used to "
"automatically trigger new builds for your project and synchronize your "
"repository's branches and tags."
msgstr ""
"你的仓库还需配置为在仓库事件发生时通过 Webhook 向 Read the Docs 推送更新。Webhook "
"更新用于自动触发项目的新构建，并同步仓库的分支和标签。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:150
msgid ""
"This step is the same for public repositories, follow the directions for "
":doc:`manually configuring a Git repository integration </guides/setup/git-"
"repo-manual>`."
msgstr "此步骤与公开仓库相同，请遵循 :doc:`手动配置 Git 仓库集成 </guides/setup/git-repo-manual>` 的说明。"

